[@3]
<h2>~ySun Thief</h2>
<p>
Enemy islands approaching!!!!

[@7]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
Looks like we have company...

[@10]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
They will regret fighting us.

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Offensive</h2> 
<i>"For a good Offence, One must have a good Defence."<br>
--Old Proverb</i>
<p>You and your newly formed allies head toward Lord Gunton and his growing powers.
Then you come upon a couple of bandits who don't look friendly.  Make them pay for delaying you!
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>You have defeated the bandits.  Now continue on towards Lord Gunton!
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b7

[ai1TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~sThunder Bandit</h2>
<p>
I want YOUR temple to BURN!!!!!!

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>~rWind Bandit</h2>
<p>
You fools! I shall not perish like this!

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
One down!

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
Help me! I am in grave danger!

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I shall have your head for this!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
It seems that you are responsable for his death...I shall see to it that your head will have a bounty on it.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>~sThunder Bandit</h2>
<p>
Blast It!!!!!  We give!!! Just cease your attack and we will let you go through.
$Button=Accept,Tell,Purple

[Purple]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
Thats more like it.  Come on, lets go!
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b7

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>~ySun Thief</h2>
<p>
Ack!  You shall pay for this!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have died in battle, what happened to your allies is unknowed, as you are dead.  Try Again!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
